      "q": "How much federal contract money goes to Kentucky?",
      "a": "Kentucky receives $8.2B in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. The state has 80,348 awards with an average award size of $102K, and obligations fell 21.2% year over year. Fiscal-year trends show FY23 at $12.5B, FY24 at $12.3B, FY25 at $10.4B, and FY26 at $8.2B."
    },
